# The imported gallery: one of everything the two DOS-game importers
# brought in, in a hall you can walk the length of. It is the check that an
# import worked, and the range the hostile AI is tried out in.
#
# Written by `go run ./tools/mapgen -gallery` out of whatever is installed,
# then compiled by `go run ./tools/mapgen -map imported` like any other level.
#
# Four bays, in the order you meet them: the scenery, standing in rows with
# room to walk between; the characters that do not fight; everything that
# does; and the game's own 3D models at the far end. F1 -> Cheats -> Give
# All Weapons before going past the second bay.

size 160 6 272
ambient 0.75 0.75 0.82 0.85
ceiling 26 26 34
floor 18 18 24
fog 150 420

block hall 21 22 20
fill hall 0 0 0 159 5 271
clear 2 1 2 157 3 269

spawn 8.5 1.5 8.5 dir=0,1

